# Night-light-PCB-prototype: what goes into the repo

# 1. Ignore every loose file and folder at the top level...
/*

# 2. ...but let every top-level folder through (their contents are included)
!/*/

# 3. ...except the editor history folder
/.history/

# 4. Top-level files I do want
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Night light PCB.kicad_pro
!/Night light PCB.kicad_pcb
!/Night light PCB.kicad_sch
!/fp-lib-table
!/sym-lib-table

# 5. Junk that should never be committed, at any depth
.pio/
*.lck
~*.lck
*-backups/
